    "en": {
      "trackName": "2048 :)",
      "description": "The classic number puzzle you love, now with multiplayer, challenge levels and brand-new obstacle tiles!\n\nSwipe to move all tiles. When two tiles with the same number touch, they merge into one. Simple to learn, hard to master. How far can you go?\n\n■ GAME MODES\n\n• Classic Mode\nReach the highest tile you can and beat your personal best.\n\n• Multiplayer Mode\nTired of playing alone? Use Game Center to auto-match with players worldwide or invite your friends to a head-to-head race.\n\n• Challenge Mode\n132 hand-crafted levels to test your strategy.\n\n• Obstacle Mode\nSpecial tiles shake things up: x2 doubles a tile, ÷2 halves it, and X blocks your path. Every move counts!\n\n■ FEATURES\n\n• 5 difficulty levels: 256, 512, 1024, 2048 and 4096\n• Two ways to win: chase the highest score, or reach the goal in the fewest moves\n• Game Center leaderboards for Highest Score and Fewest Moves on every difficulty\n• 27 achievements to unlock: reach bigger tiles, higher scores and more multiplayer wins\n• Auto-save: your progress is saved after every move and every multiplayer match, so you can always pick up right where you left off\n• Optional in-app purchase to remove ads and support the developer\n\n■ WE'D LOVE YOUR FEEDBACK\n\nEvery review helps us make this game better. If you enjoy playing, please take a moment to rate us. Thank you!",
      "releaseNotes": "• Now optimized for iPhone Duo, on both the outer and inner displays\n• A completely redesigned interface for iPhone and iPad\n• Updated for the latest iOS\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements",
